I've pasted a log below (from `kujua-transport`) showing the problem in detail. Essentially, it's possible for a "send" operation to be initiated (via the Kujua Lite user interface) that causes a not-yet-run HTTP callback (on _bulk_docs) to yield a document update conflict.

I'm not sure how to fix this yet.

The problem isn't showing up on SMSsync, because it seems to invoke callbacks after merely queueing messages to be sent -- it doesn't wait for the telecom acknowledgement. This makes the window in which the issue could be reproduced on SMSsync quite small.

