We're getting more and more requests to push data to external systems like DHIS2; these systems have their own identifiers (some universally-unique, some not) for facilities. These are each called an organizationalUnit in DHIS 2.

We'd like to be able to pair each facility with a single external identifier when creating/editing facilities, and then give users the option to include these external identifiers in any downloadable reports.

Our hope is that this will save us from needing to do a whole bunch of ID mapping during data import -- Kujua will already know the external system's facility identifiers, and importing would just be a matter of transforming each row in to a collection of "data elements" (read: an entity/attribute/value tuple used by systems like DHIS 2) and inserting them.

