Some options I am aware of that we might be able to pursue:
- add this object under app_settings. This gives tech leads and impact staff access through webapp UI for editing app_settings, though I'm not sure if that is accessible to PMs.
- create some kind of form where this kind of info can be submit. I believe the webapp UI has some kind form entry method, which is probably friendly for tech leads, PMs, and impact staff, but forms don't store hierarchical information very well.

There might be better options.

Ideally we can backport this feature request into 0.4 or 0.5 systems and support it for 0.6 in the future.

